--- B. ADAPT TIMING CLARIFICATION (microseconds, mean +/- SD) ---
   Adapt checked total        77.617 +/-  0.082   (PROTOCOL: las_adapt above, incl. internal PreVerify)
   witness-add only            2.471 +/-  0.009   (DIAGNOSTIC ONLY: z=z_hat+r'; not a protocol op)
